  "title": "Napa Cabbage Salad",
  "description": "Serve this tasty napa cabbage salad with crunchy toasted ramen and almonds for a crowd-pleasing dish that&#39;ll get rave reviews at your next potluck.",
  "authors": [
    "Carol"
  ],
